/RAG Project/chroma_db/
#Because chroma_db contains the actual vector database created from your documents.
#It creates a local chroma_db folder containing the stored vectors and document data.
#Why don't we upload it?
#  Because AskDoc AI is designed to create the database from whatever document the user uploads.
#    So if you upload your current chroma_db:
#     it contains data from your practice document
#     it makes the repository unnecessarily large
#     it isn't needed for deployment